# Firebase settings for CueMii.
#
# Committed on purpose: these identify the project rather than granting access.
# The web API key is visible in any browser that loads the app, and access is
# controlled by the Firestore security rules.
#
# Note: the dev server only reads this file at startup — restart npm start after
# changing it.

